      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} hey, thanks for looking into this. I haven't been able to replicate the issue in a solo server regardless of avatars swapped. In order for the bug to happen, I spawned into a public Black Cat server (using the first Avatar ID) with about 20 random people, where everyone was hidden via safety settings. I then swapped into the second and third avatar IDs, then back to the first avatar ID, and all of the local-only contacts were gone. After that I took image 2.",
