      "mergeID": "67853cd71910bcf9043fa406",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The “Contact Receiver” embedded in the avatar sometimes disappears.\n\nIt is not “no response” but “the Receiver itself disappears”. This has been confirmed with an overlay.\n\nIt does not happen every time, but the specific condition is unknown.\n\nThe following conditions are frequently observed.\n\n1. It is likely to occur when there are many people using the same avatar as a clone, etc.\n\n2. It tends to occur in worlds with many people.\n\nSometimes it can be fixed by re-uploading avatars or moving worlds, but it also recurs immediately.\n\nThis is very troubling.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "The “Contact Receiver” incorporated into the avatar may disappear.",
